<title>USA: Enron Oil elects Mark Papa president.</title>
<headline>Enron Oil elects Mark Papa president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co said Wednesday that it elected Mark Papa, president of North America operations, president of the company.</p>
<p>Enron said in a release that Papa will replace Forrest Hoglund, who will continue in his duties as chairman of the board and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company added that Papa will continue in his position as president of North America operations while assuming other management responsibilities.</p>
</text>
